  {
   "id": "TRIGGER_PREFERS_PROJECTILE",
   "route": "component_composition",
   "detail": "The trigger dispatch (0x742550) routes a weapon with the projectile flag to its projectile trigger and never to its beam trigger, so a Liberator owning both would still fire bullets."
  },
  {
